# AC 3 and AC 4 alone, because they are the two that varied.
#
# One question, so a slow thinking model can be asked the same thing without
# sitting through three turns it has already answered. What is being read is
# the `axiom: run_command(...)` line: whether there is one at all, what program
# it names, and whether it exits 0 the first time.

mark: AC 3 and AC 4 - the command has to work the first time
send: list the files in the directory you are working in
wait: 100
send: /exit
